  <Vertical id="bmod_h1_q4c" title="4c. Consequences">
    <Markdown id="bmod_h1_q4c_prompt">
## 4c. What are the CONSEQUENCES of engaging in your unwanted target behavior?

List and describe **two** examples. A consequence happens *after* the behavior
and results directly from it.

You must use the word **consequence** or **consequences** in your answer.
