  <Vertical id="bmod_h1_q5" title="5. Why do you continue?">
    <Markdown id="bmod_h1_q5_prompt">
## 5. Why do you think you continue to engage in the unwanted target behavior?

Even though it results in undesired consequences, something keeps it going. It
may be to gain something, to escape a task, to receive attention, or something
else.

List and describe **two** examples.

*For example: "I continue to not drink enough water because soda tastes so
good, and I get my sugar fix."*
    </Markdown>

